 root.innerHTML=`<div class="psy-ir-roster-card"><header><h2>🐾 Pokémon do Idle</h2><button data-roster-close>✕</button></header><p>Esta equipe pertence apenas ao seu personagem Idle. A qualidade define o multiplicador base; IVs e Nature dão bônus menores. Pokémon capturados começam no Nv.1. Evoluções aparecem com nível, item e custo exigidos.</p><h3>Equipe (${p.team.length}/6)</h3><div>${p.team.map((m,i)=>card(m,i,'team')).join('')}</div><h3>Box Idle (${p.box.length})</h3><div>${p.box.map((m,i)=>card(m,i,'box')).join('')||'<p>Capture Pokémon nas hunts para preencher sua Box.</p>'}</div></div>`;root.style.display='flex';root.querySelector('[data-roster-close]').onclick=()=>root.style.display='none';root.querySelectorAll('[data-box-up]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{const m=p.box.splice(Number(b.dataset.boxUp),1)[0];if(m&&p.team.length<6)p.team.push(m);queueIdleSave();openIdleRoster()});root.querySelectorAll('[data-team-active]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{const i=Number(b.dataset.teamActive);if(i>0){p.team.unshift(p.team.splice(i,1)[0]);queueIdleSave();if(running)syncPlayerStats();openIdleRoster()}});root.querySelectorAll('[data-team-down]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{const i=Number(b.dataset.teamDown);if(i>0){p.box.push(p.team.splice(i,1)[0]);queueIdleSave();openIdleRoster()}});root.querySelectorAll('[data-idle-evolve]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>idleEvolvePokemon(b.dataset.idleKind,Number(b.dataset.idleIndex),Number(b.dataset.idleTo)))
